        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="Read with README.md and the dependency views. Dependencies point from the actor relying on something to its provider. Repeated endpoint IDs refer to the same element. Conditional tasks describe responsibilities, not a mandatory sequence of process steps." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontColor=#243246;" vertex="1" parent="1">
